OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery expansion rejected over
OL,4,Aparking worries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major expansion of a GP
OL,7,Fsurgery in Peterborough have been
OL,8,Frejected after concerns over parking.
OL,10,FWerrington Healthcare Ltd submitted a
OL,11,Fproposal for a two-storey extension at
OL,12,Fits practice in Church Street,
OL,13,Fincluding four new consultation rooms
OL,14,Fand a backup emergency generator.
OL,16,FResidents and the local highways
OL,17,Fauthority said the development could
OL,18,Fworsen an existing shortage of parking
OL,19,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
