OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery expansion rejected over
OL,4,Aparking worries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the planning meeting of the council
OL,7,Fon Tuesday, councillors rejected the
OL,8,Fproposal by seven votes to three.
